/vendor
/node_modules
/.phpunit.cache
/.phpunit.mysql.cache
.phpunit.result.cache
.DS_Store

# The Control Panel bundle is a build artefact, not source. It reaches an
# installing site through the GitHub release (`extra.download-dist` in
# composer.json + pixelfear/composer-dist-plugin), built by
# .github/workflows/release-dist.yml. Committing it would put a minified blob
# in every diff and in the history for good.
#
# The hot file must never ship under any scheme: its presence tells the
# Statamic Vite tag to load assets from a dev server the site does not run.
/resources/dist

# A library must not pin its consumers: Composer ignores a dependency lock file
# entirely, so committing one constrains nothing and only makes the CI matrix
# lie about which versions were actually resolved.
/composer.lock
/.phpstan
